* Organizing student updates and electing ECM student representatives for each generation * Participation with Samdech Techo's volunteer medical team * Participating in blood donation, participating in high school exam observation * Participating in environmental clean-up activities * Collaboration with the National Olympic Committee of Cambodia in the National Sports and Half Marathon and many other social activities.
Please note that AMT is divided into 18 groups, each group is responsible for the work of students in different schools in the capital to ensure the attention and learning efficiency of AMK students. Continued at each university.
