Mr. Pheng Nil said that today's inspection aims to ensure food safety because it is very important in society and daily life. "Responsibility for food safety is a joint responsibility of professional institutions, importers, producers, distributors and consumers as well, because health is a key factor in the survival of life," he said. .
At the same time, he confirmed that the professional officers inspected many items and tested the items in which the food did not find any chemicals. He also advised all vendors in the exhibition to carry the goods with the correct item date to avoid selling expired goods.
