BEIJING, July 24 (Xinhua) - The Ministry of Defense of the People's Republic of China (PRC) on July 24, 2019, announced that China has not reached an agreement with Cambodia to allow the Chinese military to stand on Cambodian territorial waters. False information.
In response to this sensitive issue, the head of the Royal Government of Cambodia, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, claimed that the dissemination of information about Cambodia secretly signing with China using military bases was the worst fabrication against Cambodia.
The Prime Minister of Cambodia, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, gave an interview to Lim Chea Vutha, Executive Director of Fresh News this morning, July 22, 2019, with the following content: "This is the worst fabrication against Cambodia. "This does not happen because foreign military bases are against the Cambodian constitution."
Please be informed that in the past, Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Cambodia's top military officials have issued several public statements denying this issue and claiming that Cambodia is an independent, sovereign state, the Cambodian Constitution does not allow it to be based. Foreign troops on its territory.
