(Pursat): Mr. Mao Thunin, Governor of Pursat Province, announced to provide 5 steel bridges (ballets) to the people in Romlech Commune, Bakan District, Pursat Province for public use. Directly at the irrigation system in Romlech commune and in response to the insistent requests of the actual needs of the people there.
