He continued that the festival of Preah Vossa is a festival that starts from the 1st day of the month of Asat to the 15th day of the month of Assoch and lasts for 3 months, which our Cambodian brothers and sisters follow in the Buddhist way. He also called on all people to take good care of their young children, because this is the rainy season, it will be prone to various diseases, especially dengue fever, to be hygienic by living clean and drinking. Clean, always clean.
