(Battambang): The Ministry of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation provided health screening and health care to 328 poor people in the community in Thmor Kol district, Battambang province on July 23, 2019.
The handover ceremony was attended by Mr. Sem Sokha, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation, a representative of Mr. Vong Soth, Minister of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation, and Mr. Yi Veasna, Board Member of the Disability Fund. Health care policy and opening bank accounts for 328 poor people with disabilities in the community from Thmor Koul district, Battambang province within the ACLEDA Bank branch in Thmor Koul district.
