Senior Minister Sun Chanthol inspects National Road 58 and urges Chinese companies to improve some points
(Banteay Meanchey): During a visit to inspect the quality of roads already built and under construction in the northwest of the country on Monday, July 22, 2019, after inspecting National Road 55 and National Road 5, Senior Minister Sun Chanthol The Ministry of Public Works and Transport (MPWT) continues to inspect National Road 58, a national road connecting National Road 5 in Poipet City, Oddar Meanchey Province to Oddar Meanchey Province.
The inspection of National Road No. 58 was also attended by representatives of construction companies, technical consultants and officials of the Department of Public Works and Transport of Oddar Meanchey and Banteay Meanchey provinces.
