Mr. Kong Koam said on his Facebook page on July 22, 2019 that the United States in July 2019 made a law on "Democratic Kampuchea 2019", which, if passed through the Senate and the President, is positive. It is expected to take another year, which coincides with the 2020 US presidential election.
"The authorities in Cambodia are not surprised by the law, which can only be a scarecrow, according to the policy of President Trump, the United States will respect the policy of building and defending other countries themselves," he said.
