Negative signs of Singapore economy are becoming a concern for the whole of Asia
(Singapore): The sharp drop in exports of products and the slow growth rate are causing concern about Singapore's economic future. This also makes analysts realize that it could be a negative sign for the whole of Asia. This is according to a quote from the Thai Bangkok Post on Monday night, July 22, 2019.
As a small country, Singapore is highly vulnerable to external shocks and is considered a tool for measuring the level of demand for products as well as global services. This prosperous country is heavily dependent on trade, which is generally one of the first regions in Asia to suffer from the global economic crisis, as the effects of those effects will continue to spread throughout the region. Only once later.
