(Kampot): The Royal Government of Cambodia has set 20-21-22 December 2019 to organize the 8th Sea Festival, 2nd round in Kampot province under the presidency of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and Samdech Kittiprittbandit Bun. Rany Hun Sen.
In order to successfully prepare for this annual big tourism event, the Ministry of Tourism, Kampot Provincial Administration, relevant departments and units around the province met frequently, on July 22, 2019, the relevant ministries, institutions, departments and units met. The second time at Kampot Provincial Hall under the chairmanship of Mr. Thong Khon, Minister of Tourism and Mr. Chiao Tay, Governor of Kampot to monitor and determine the work for further implementation.
After the Governor of Chiao Tai and each representative in charge reported on their respective work, Minister Thong Khon outlined some work to be done together, including:
* Promote the promotion of various tourist destinations in Kampot province, especially Thansur Bokor resort, agro-tourism area, baby animals, pepper plantations and pepper products, Kampot, Phnom Kampong Trach, Teuk Chhou resort and many other tourist resorts.
* Be prepared to exhibit local products, which are agricultural products exported locally, such as durian, banana, rambutan, coconut, dragon fruit, etc.
* Be prepared to organize art events, performances, dances, music and invite the art groups of neighboring countries and provinces that are allies of Kampot to participate in the upcoming event.
* Urge the Kampot provincial administration to prepare new beaches to create more attractive tourism products.
* Suggest that Sokha Bokor Company organize as many entertainment events as possible to contribute to attracting more tourists in this big event, such as jungle trekking, marathon running, cycling, boat racing and sightseeing in some attractive areas. More on Bokor Mountain.
