In order to strengthen the management of tax collection effectively, transparently and effectively, the General Department of Taxation would like to introduce the implementation of withholding tax to the insurance enterprises that have extended life insurance to non-resident taxpayers as follows:
1. An insurance enterprise that pays to a non-resident taxpayer for reinsurance of life insurance is subject to withholding tax under Article 26 (one) of the Law on Taxes for Net Reinsurance Premiums.
2. In the event that the net renewal premium is negative, the insurance enterprise that pays the non-resident taxpayer for reinsurance of life insurance is allowed to deduct the remaining premium with the gross premium in subsequent months. .
3: Life insurance enterprises must receive preferential treatment for voluntary tax correction and additional tax payment for past deficit payments no later than December 31, 2019. .
