(Takeo): Chip Mong Company has brought the high and precious ties of Samdech Akka Moha Sena Padei Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and Samdech Kittiprittbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen through the construction of 18 km concrete road. The meter, valued at US $ 7,200,000 for easy travel, has been officially inaugurated.
