He claimed that dengue fever was a deadly disease that could kill people of all ages if all patients did not seek medical attention for timely treatment. In fact, this is the day of the campaign to educate and apply Abet spray, tiger mosquito repellent to prevent the spread of dengue fever throughout the province, as well as to spread awareness about dengue fever, easy to prevent and save.
