The launch of the "Bakong System" test is a breakthrough in the new era of the financial sector in Cambodia. The National Bank of Cambodia is proud to be the first country to launch the latest blockchain technology in the financial sector to enable the creation and promotion of a financial environment aimed at providing financial services to the people. Every Cambodian.
Please be informed that on October 18, 2017, Ms. Chea Serey, Technical Director General of the National Bank of Cambodia, met with the Payment Committee of the Banking Association of Cambodia and representatives of payment service providers to discuss the Bakong Project, a new initiative of the Bank. The National of Cambodia is involved in a case study on the feasibility of launching e-currency for interbank payment transactions.
