At the same time, the Secretary of State said that a professional doctor or therapist who is not registered with the board of doctors and without a license from the board of doctors may be a person without a degree or medical skills endanger the lives of clients, may A doctor with the right degree, but not competent and physically fit.
Prof. Thea Kruy added that doctors have the right degree, have the right physical fitness, but are not registered with the right license provided by the Board of Doctors asked if they can practice professionally, he stressed that in any category. However, practitioners who do not have a professional license provided by the medical board may face criminal penalties.
