(Phnom Penh): The General Command of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces (RCAF) held a meeting this morning, July 19, 2019 to review the results of the first half of the year and set the direction for the second half of 2019 under the chairmanship of General Ith Sarath. Deputy Commander and Joint Chiefs of Staff.
According to the report, under the leadership of the Head of the Royal Government, the Ministry of National Defense and the Commander-in-Chief of the Armed Forces, all units and units at all levels have worked hard to overcome all difficulties. Duties to protect the sovereignty and territorial integrity through regular patrols and border checkpoints.
At the same time, it has actively contributed to maintaining political stability, security, social order, and timely suppression of inactivity, theft, robbery, drug trafficking, forest crime, as well as other crimes.
