By: Political observers, Sihanoukville authorities continue to crack down on vehicles parked on public roads.
(Preah Sihanouk): Preah Sihanouk Provincial Authority on July 18, 2019 continued the hot operation by arresting vehicles parked on the road in disorderly manner and storing them at Sihanoukville City Hall to call the owners for education.
During the operation under the direct command of Mr. Kouch Chamroeun, Governor of Preah Sihanouk Province, the police seized a total of 16 vehicles, including 5 cars, 10 motorcycles and 1 tricycle.
Regarding this operation, Mr. Kouch Chamroeun had stated that it was done in order for all vehicles to regain consciousness in using public roads, especially parking must be orderly and reduce traffic congestion.
