The emergency meeting to discuss the work includes:
1: Assign local authorities (provinces, districts, communes and villages) to cooperate with the Sihanoukville International Airport Authority in taking measures to prevent the construction of buildings near the fence in front of the runway RWY21 and RWY03 and the construction of the airport development project. International Sihanoukville.
2: Assign the task to the Sihanoukville Provincial Authority in cooperation with the inter-ministerial working group and the Ministry of Environment to continue to discuss and find a solution with 62 families who have been living next to the fence at the entrance to the Sihanoukville International Airport.
3: Put the machinery in the process of constructing the land safety fence in the development area of Sihanoukville International Airport on July 17, 2018.
