* First: the exchange of information from victims of human trafficking for the purpose of repatriation and integration
* Second: Facilitation of Repatriation and Integration
* Third: Coordinating efforts to provide legal assistance to victims of human trafficking
* Fourth: Monitoring and estimating the results of repatriation and integration
