(Preah Sihanouk): Major General Chuon Narin, Preah Sihanouk Provincial Police Commissioner, warned police officers throughout the province not to use vehicles with police license plates, sirens and intervention vehicles to use or drive in the private sector or to people Foreigners, especially the police force, must not go out to work as security guards at karaoke clubs or to protect the private sector.
