Trademarks not covered by Article 2 of the Trademark Law and acts of dishonest competition, such as brand, smell, taste or sound for a foreign country, are also protected, but separately in the Kingdom. In Cambodia, there is no law yet to protect those trademarks, which means that invisible signs of trademark law are not allowed to be registered for protection in Cambodia.
