Lt. Gen. Hun Manet added that the head of the Royal Government, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, and CPP officials still stand on one position: as long as the people continue to support the CPP, Samdech will help lead the country so that the government has the opportunity to lead the people. Citizens, we continue to strive to serve the people.
At the same time, Lt. Gen. Hun Manet emphasized that "peace can be maintained only if all the people work together to maintain the peace and stability that we have, which focuses on building a life, not to be provoked by any party." .
The lieutenant general continued that the principle of the Royal Government, the national leadership is to make this country a prosperous country, a happy country for the people to live in peace and prosperity. We have succeeded in getting rid of the Pol Pot regime so that we can work hard to build the country from a difficult period, and we have achieved peace and development until now.
The lieutenant general continued that the people need to develop like now, we have investors from abroad, the children of the people have the opportunity to study everywhere, the Royal Government creates job opportunities, both public and private, for the children of the people. In addition, the Royal Government has worked hard to address the growing needs of the people.
"We have worked hard to develop and renovate schools, bridges, pagodas, hospitals, electricity, and push quality services closer to the people of all 25 provinces. This is the role of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, even though he did not come in person today. "Still working through various teams to look at those shortcomings." This was further confirmed by Lt. Gen. Hun Manet.
Lt. Gen. Hun Manet emphasized, "We have been resolving for more than 40 years, but it is not over yet. We will continue to address the needs of the people and keep the peace for the next generation, not as difficult as before, as long as Samdech Techo Hun Sen "Leading the country."
At the same time, Lt. Gen. Hun Manet said that the Korean people are interested in Cambodia, firstly because our country is a country struggling to recover from the war and secondly, our people are good, working hard with bare hands, and most importantly Is to provide the ability to build the country.
He said that the Royal Government of Korea plays an important role in both investing in the private sector and civil society to help the people, and also hopes that the friendly side will continue to help in the development of this nation further for the whole of humanity, humanitarian work. No matter what the Khmer people, no matter what the Korean people, no matter what the country, they are all one nation, one people, one people.
"This theory is very good and our country is lucky to be out of the flames of war." This is the additional emphasis of Lt. Gen. Hun Manet.
On that occasion, Lt. Gen. Hun Manet would also like to thank the people of Korea through the Rotary Club, philanthropists and the national team to help Chheu Teal commune, which makes this Chheu Teal commune, Svay Chrum district a huge health center. Remote to a place with a hospital to serve the general medical services according to the needs of the people.
