(Preah Sihanouk): In order to join the fight against dengue fever, the Provincial Red Cross Branch, in cooperation with Preah Sihanouk Provincial Health Department, on the morning of July 12, 2019, launched a campaign to apply Abet to kill water worms, eradicate tiger mosquitoes, reduce and eliminate Dengue fever in children as well as the elderly who are at risk from mosquito bites.
