He added that the prince always cares for the people, regardless of race, color or political affiliation, and asked the families of the victims of dengue fever across the country to recover quickly. Disease.
During the Abet campaign, he also stated that in order to get rid of tiger mosquitoes, they have to clean up around the house, get rid of water places such as pools, ponds, tires, bottles, as well as other water equipment must be burned or removed to prevent Provide water, which is a source of eggs for tiger mosquitoes and mosquito nets when sleeping. Cambodian Red Cross in Siem Reap launches joint campaign to eradicate tiger mosquito breeding grounds and sources to prevent dengue fever
