(Phnom Penh): In addition to regular inspections of goods in the market every day to strengthen the protection of people's welfare, on July 12, 2019, Camcontrol Phnom Penh International Port in cooperation with officials of the Department of Commerce brought a test vehicle Mobile inspection of food products in 5 markets, including: Chbar Ampov Central Market, Chbar Ampov Vegetable Market, Prek Pra Market, Champouk K'aek Market and Prek Eang Market.
