In response to South Korean concerns, Pompeo agreed to continue cooperation and strengthen ties between the three parties, while experts believe that South Korea may seek help from Washington to help resolve the dispute with Tokyo. .
Japan last week restricted the sale of raw materials for smartphone screens and chips to South Korean tech companies, and reiterated that Tokyo would remain unchanged.
But Seoul, meanwhile, has warned that it has no choice but to retaliate if Tokyo still refuses to lift sanctions imposed in retaliation by a South Korean court. Ordered some Japanese companies to compensate South Koreans who were forced to work in Japanese industry during World War II.
