The Deputy Prime Minister expressed his deep gratitude to Ms. Yong Sarah Zhou and commended the International Monetary Fund for its continuous contribution to macroeconomic stability in Cambodia through close cooperation between the Royal Government of Cambodia and the Fund. International currency.
Ms. Yong Sarah Zhou, Head of the International Monetary Fund (IMF) Representative in Cambodia, expressed her deep gratitude to the Deputy Prime Minister, appreciating and congratulating Cambodia on its achievements as a witness and evaluator. High on the close cooperation between the IMF and the Cambodian government.
