Residents said that the perpetrators were organized into groups and would actively travel in order to demonstrate their power, such as the Highlander and Lexus engines, and specially designed with more experienced Imported from Vietnam, both for boat installation and installation of cold fishing tackle.
The community said that some of the boat traders' boats had air guns to threaten any community who dared to crack down on these things. On the group of electric boats of the perpetrators in Kampong Chhnang province.
At the same time, the spokesman of the provincial police informed that:
* Due to the geographical situation there, it is difficult for traffic (there are many blocks) to patrol, control and crack down.
* The Economic Crime Police Force, in cooperation with the provincial fisheries experts, will crack down on illegal fishing during the closed fishing season everywhere in Kampong Chhnang province.
* Request the fishing community fishing to participate in protecting natural resources, especially do not fish during the spawning season.
