According to the presentation of the progress of the project to improve 22 roads in Sihanoukville, including:
* First: Implementation project using the budget of the Ministry of Public Works and Transport * Second: Project plan for the development of Neak Reach tourism area * Third: Road restoration plan in the development area in Oknha Mong port * Fourth: Infrastructure planning as a priority Prepare for the 2022 ASEAN Summit.
