(Kampong Thom): In order to prevent the impact on the health of consumers through food, on July 9, 2019, CamControl Kampong Thom Branch, in cooperation with the Department of Commerce and the Market Commission, continued to inspect and disseminate food quality and safety at the market. Krava is located in Krava commune, Baray district, Kampong Thom province.
