Cambodian Customs Delegation Attends Annual Meeting of the World Customs Cooperation Council and Global Trade Assistance Review Meeting 2019
(Brussels): A delegation from the General Department of Customs and Excise of Cambodia of the Ministry of Economy and Finance led by Dr. Kun Nhim, a Royal Government delegate in charge of the Director General of the General Department of Customs and Excise of Cambodia, attended the Annual Meeting of the Council. 133/134 World Customs Cooperation at the World Customs Headquarters in Brussels, Belgium.
