(Bangkok): Bumrungrad International Hospital is one of the leading hospitals in providing cancer treatment with modern and innovative genetic testing that will lead to accurate diagnosis and treatment. Better analysis of results for cancer patients.
Some cancers can be found more frequently in some families, Dr. Harit said. Thus, genetic testing will benefit some patients as it provides more information about the genes of patients and the genes of their family members.
Dr Harit added that although standard therapies are still effective, in some cases, there is still a need for greater understanding of the disease status. For this reason, this new technology plays an indispensable role in assessing tumor genetic variation and can better expand treatment options for some patients.
He said that today the use of genetic testing (CGP) technology of tumors can provide more understanding of medical-related genetic variation, which is a factor that allows us to achieve clear goals in treatment decisions and increase the choice of Treatment of diseases.
Bumrungrad International Hospital has partnered with a number of partners to provide state-of-the-art diagnostic technology, which is now able to perform advanced genetic testing, including various diagnostic tests on human bodies (tumors) to detect DNA of the tumor floating in the patient's bloodstream.
