This exhibition is the only trade platform for industry, Cambodia International Machinery Industry Fair and Cambodia International Garment and Textile Industry Fair is a potential exhibition covering many industries such as: plastic, rubber, printing, packaging. , Food processing, Agricultural machinery, Electronic equipment and accessories, Automotive parts, Electrical engineering and Garment and textiles.
