To the relatives and family of Mr. Pheng Ton and Mr. Wasim Samreth, he thanked Dr. Chet Chealy, the current Rector of the Royal University of Phnom Penh and all the management, faculty and students who initiated the construction of the statue. The leadership of the two former rectors.
