(Preah Sihanouk): Police in Preah Sihanouk province launched an operation to crack down on drug trafficking and use, detaining three suspects and confiscating a large amount of drugs and some exhibits. This was confirmed by Major General Chuon Narin, Police Commissioner of Preah Sihanouk Province to Fresh News on July 08, 2019.
