The first suspect: May Srey La, female, 16 years old, unspecified occupation, current address is not exact, hometown: Group 2, Village 1, Sangkat 2, Preah Sihanouk City / Province, and the second suspect: Nem Srey Mao, female, 20 years old. Occupation Uncertain Current address Uncertain Hometown Group 2 Village 1 Sangkat 2 City / Province Preah Sihanouk Exhibits include: white gram powder, suspected drugs, 11 small packages, 2 mobile phones.
In another case, on July 6, 2019, the Anti-Drug Police Office cracked down on a drug case behind the Phsar Leu car park in Village 1, Sangkat 2, Sihanoukville Province, and arrested One of the suspects, Seng Theary, female, Khmer, 31 years old, unspecified occupation, currently resides in Village 1, Sangkat 2, Preah Sihanouk Province.
Major General Chuon Narin said that the exhibits confiscated included: 4 large packages of white crystalline powder suspected to be drugs, weighing 197.50 grams (net weight), and a black OPPO mobile phone. Currently, the suspect and the above exhibits are being processed by the specialized force to handle the case.
