He said that in Svay Rieng province, the disease broke out in Russey Chuor Khang Tbong village, Krol Ko commune, Svay Chrum district, Svay Rieng province. In Takeo province, the explosion occurred in Ampil village, Ponley commune, Angkor Borey district, Takeo province.
