Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng: The lawsuit filed by Sam Rainsy is the first lawsuit in his life to urge politicians to adhere to morality and avoid fabricating provocative information (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Interior on July 08 This year 2019 confirms that the recent filing of a lawsuit against Sam Rainsy, the leader of the extremist opposition group, in court is Samdech's first complaint in this lifetime.
Samdech stated that the filing of the lawsuit against Sam Rainsy is a wake-up call for some politicians to adhere to the dignity, morality and virtue of the profession, to avoid fabricating information to incite, inspire, maliciously slander and divide to fulfill. Its unjust purpose and ambition and its group.
Samdech continued that this complaint is also to demand justice for Samdech and all the victims who were painted by Sam Rainsy and accused of distorting the truth.
Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng called on all politicians to adhere to their conscience and conscience in their actions by putting the national interest first, rather than committing acts that lead to social division and harm to the Supreme Being. National interest and people.
