The Senate will convene on July 11 to review and comment on five draft laws (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): After deliberations in the Standing Committee meeting, the Senate decided on the 11th In July 2019, to continue its third session to review and comment on five draft laws approved by the National Assembly.
This morning, July 8, 2019, the meeting of the Standing Committee was chaired by Samdech Say Chhum, President of the Senate.
The five draft laws that are on the agenda of the upcoming Senate session include:
1. Review and comment on the draft law on the approval of the payment guarantee of the Royal Government of the Kingdom of Cambodia to SPHP (Cambodia) Co., Ltd.
2: Review and comment on the draft law on the approval of the payment guarantee of the Royal Government of the Kingdom of Cambodia to Smeth Tech or New Web Ek.
3. Examine and comment on the draft law on the approval of the payment guarantee of the Royal Government of the Kingdom of Cambodia to the proposed company Co., Ltd.
4. Review and comment on the draft law on the approval of the Kingdom of Cambodia to become a member of the Agreement on Port Ownership Measures to Prevent and Eliminate Illegal and Unauthorized Fishing.
5: Review and comment on the draft law on the approval of the National Strategic Development Plan 2019-2023.
