Senior Minister Kun Kim, Representative of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Presides Over a Medal for Relief Workers
(Preah Sihanouk): General Kun Kim, Senior Minister in charge of Special Missions and First Vice President of the National Committee for Disaster Management, High Representative of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, on the morning of July 7, 2019. Medal to the forces that participated in rescuing the victims of the collapse of a seven-story building in Sihanoukville on June 22.
The medal ceremony was held at the Ream Naval Base in Sihanoukville. On behalf of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Mr. Kun Kim stated at the medal ceremony that the awarding of the medal was to express gratitude and appreciation to all the rescue forces who sacrificed their physical and mental strength to participate in the rescue operation and solve the sad problem. This.
