(Kandal): Senior Minister Sun Chanthol, Minister of Public Works and Transport, on Saturday, July 6, 2019, inspected the quality and construction of National Road No. 21 from Koh Thom District Stadium to Chrey Thom Village, Commune. Sampov Poun (Vietnam border) is located in Koh Thom district, Kandal province, with the participation of the leaders of the Ministry, local authorities, government officials, journalists and the people.
