"Taking this opportunity, I would like to urge the trainees who participated in the 2019 Infantry and Infantry Tactical Training Course, although short-lived, to take the knowledge and skills gained from the training on time," he said. Recently, to conduct research and expand the knowledge more widely to apply and use for the benefit of the organization as well as themselves in the family and society.
Lt. Gen. Chan Sopheaktra, Deputy Commander of the 4th Military Zone and Commander of the Preah Vihear Military Operation Area, said that this training course is very important for officers, deputies and soldiers of the Preah Vihear Military Operation Area under the 4th Military Zone. Now.
The Commander-in-Chief added that with the wise and effective leadership principles of the leadership at all levels, which always provides reminders on the training work skills training at all levels for all units to be trained on a regular basis. Provide the army with the ability, quality and efficiency to lead the command to achieve success in all areas.
