Mr. Sun Chanthol's remarks were made on July 6, 2019 in a meeting to celebrate the 68th anniversary of the founding of the Cambodian People's Party (June 28, 1951 - June 28, 2019) with the participation of the working group Central level assisted districts, communes, youth working groups and women's movement networks, district party members, local authorities, government officials, students and a total of 466 people.
Speaking at the meeting, Mr. Sun Chanthol expressed his deep gratitude to the people in Koh Thom district who have fully loved and supported the Cambodian People's Party, especially supporting Samdech Techo Hun Sen as Prime Minister. And develop the nation to grow further.
The Chairman of the Standing Committee of Koh Thom District Local Strengthening Committee highlighted the achievements in Koh Thom District, such as National Road 21, Koh Thom Bridge, Chrey Thom Bridge, Concrete Road in Kvat Khveang Village, schools, hospitals, pagodas, stadiums, swimming pools, factories, enterprises and Many other achievements.
