The complaint further states: "These actions clearly show that Sam Rainsy's malicious intent to incite and inspire divisions within the top leadership of the Royal Government as well as the top leadership of the CPP." "Cambodians to cause serious unrest and chaos to social security, to destroy the political stability and peace of the whole nation."
