Senior health official highlights the importance of online drug registration
(Phnom Penh): Dr. O Vandin, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Health, stated that the registration of medicines online is very important and this is a strategic goal to improve the procedures to control the quality, effectiveness and safety of pharmaceutical products circulating in the Cambodian market.
This statement was made by the Secretary of State on the occasion of presiding over the consultation workshop on visa registration, registration of pharmaceutical products, registration of foreign pharmaceutical companies and online registration of cosmetics with stakeholders, with technical support. And Finance from the World Health Organization (WHO), which took place at the Phnom Penh Hotel on July 5, 2019.
In addition, the Secretary of State of the Ministry of Health stressed the importance of online registration:
* Evaluate pharmaceutical documents quickly and reduce the company's time to register pharmaceutical products
* Transparency and accountability
* Facilitate the request for marketing and registration of pharmaceutical products
* Improve the quality of evaluation of pharmaceutical product documentation
* There is a good relationship between the pharmaceutical product management authority and the pharmaceutical distributor.
* Easy to track the registration process and provide information on delays.
At the same time, the Ministry of Health has amended the Prakas on online registration visas and requires companies to print or affix a QR Code on their product packaging to promote more effective drug regulation. Joint efforts to achieve online registration The Ministry of Health has also increased the capacity of relevant officials and pharmaceutical distributors.
"I sincerely hope that through this online registration consultation workshop, there will be significant benefits for pharmaceutical importers and pharmaceutical companies," she said.
In addition, she believes that after completing the workshop, participants will have a lot of understanding and be able to carry out online registration effectively. Online program developers and professional officers will facilitate all work in this consultative workshop.
