Mr. Pan Sosak emphasized that the first objective of the CTIS 2019 strategy is to strengthen the competitiveness to support Cambodia's exit from the least developed countries, the achievement of the Sustainable Development Goals and the 2030 vision.
With the Fourth Generation Trade Integration Strategy, Mr. Pan Sosak expressed confidence that Cambodia will continue to maintain this remarkable growth and achieve all the goals set out in the strategy. This strategy provides a clear direction for the implementation of policy activities between all stakeholders with the Ministry of Commerce.
