A Shanghai court on Friday upheld the death sentence of a man who killed his wife by cutting her body and putting it in a refrigerator for more than three months. . This was released by the Chinese news agency Xinhua on Friday, July 5, 2019.
The decision was made by the Shanghai Supreme People's Court, which rejected Zhu Xiaodong's appeal against the death sentence upheld by the Chinese Supreme People's Court in August 2018.
(Tbong Khmum): Lecturers and students of Heng Samrin University Tbong Khmum will get many benefits, especially to study in China after the university signed a Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) with Henan Normal University of China.
Mr. Pin Vannaro, Rector of Heng Samrin Tbong Khmu University, said this at the signing ceremony of the Memorandum of Understanding (MoU) between the two universities, which was held on the afternoon of July 5, 2019 at Heng Samrin Tbong Khmum University. .
Speaking on the occasion, Mr. Pin Vannaro said that the signing of the MoU has many benefits for students and professors to exchange experiences with each other and study cultural traditions, especially students of Heng Samrin University Tbong Khmum more opportunities. To continue studying in China.
Mr. Pin Vannaro said that students who study for a bachelor's degree in the second or third year can have the opportunity to study for a bachelor's degree at Henan University in China under the conditions of 3 + 1 and 2 + 2, and for students who have completed a bachelor's degree. And can go to study for a master's degree at Henan University, China.
It should be noted that the signing of the MoU between the two universities, Cambodia-China, in order to improve the education sector of the two countries, especially to strengthen the long-term alliance between Cambodia and China.
