Meaningful speech of Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the occasion of meeting with Cambodian people living in Europe
(Geneva, Switzerland): The Prime Minister of Cambodia Samdech Techo Hun Sen met with people, students and students in Switzerland and some European countries on the evening of July 4, 2019 in Switzerland.
Samdech Techo Hun Sen delivered a talk for almost 3 hours, the following are the main remarks of Samdech Techo Hun Sen:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he was very happy to be back to meet with people in Europe again after meeting in October 2018.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen called for the interception of the people of Europe to show the care of the people of Europe to the nation through legal representatives.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen exaggerated some of the allegations that people came to meet Samdech for business. Samdech Techo considered such a statement as a serious insult.
* Samdech Techo stated that Samdech could not have imagined that some Cambodians abroad could open their mouths to accuse and insult like this.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he had fought in the war zone in the past, but he had never insulted the nation.
* Samdech Techo Prime Minister stated that members of the Cambodian People's Party used to leave the party, but Samdech never insulted those who left. On the contrary, it is only because of the party's shortcomings that they walk away.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that it is a pity for Cambodia that people always act as an insult.
* Samdech Techo Prime Minister brought all Cambodians who came to see Samdech to swear to die if this meeting is rented or traded. On the other hand, if there is no rent or sale, the accused will die as well.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the meeting between Samdech and the Cambodian people in Europe is a run of the same Khmer blood.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the announcement of the July 5 demonstration by the opposition in Europe was one of their excuses to accuse Samdech of fleeing Europe.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen revealed that the opposition has just applied for a law on demonstrations in Switzerland, so on July 5, there will be no demonstrations, because the principle in Switzerland takes 48 hours to decide whether or not. For this demonstration request.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that last year it was said that the United States did not allow Samdech to step on American soil, but when Samdech went to the United States to meet the United Nations, the US authorities followed Samdech because he was a guest.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the youth movement outside has contributed more than 170,000 US dollars to help the victims of the collapse of a building in Sihanoukville. Among them, young people in Europe have more than 20,000 US dollars.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that this participation is to share the suffering of the victims and the families of the victims.
* In the case of a building collapse in Sihanoukville, Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he was very proud of the Cambodian people who helped each other in times of emergency.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also confirmed the use of military uniforms during the rescue operation in Sihanoukville.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen confirmed that Samdech has a habit of using uniforms. In the field, use the uniform in the field, the diplomatic work, use the diplomatic uniform, when visiting the workers, use the uniform to meet the workers.
* Samdech Techo confirmed that for such rescue operations, Samdech is accustomed to using military uniforms, because Samdech is also a 5 star gold general.
* Samdech Techo Prime Minister stated that during the meeting in Thailand, one ear listens to the meeting and the other ear for reporting on the rescue operation.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that when Samdech arrived at the house, Samdech seemed to hear people shouting for help.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech seems to have an instinct associated with the victims.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that if Samdech was not present at the scene, the lives of the last two victims might not have been saved.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that many Cambodians expressed their condolences for the loss in this incident. But there is a group of people who only think about subtraction.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the two ends of a bond continue to be the key strategy for solving all national problems. The first end is to maintain peace and the other end is to maintain macroeconomic stability.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also reminded of the noodle eating event. Samdech Techo, the Prime Minister, said that he had overcome the "strategy of rusting iron" by burning iron as a knife. Now, Samdech did not use the strategy of "thorn to replace thorns", but Samdech used the strategy of breaking thorns. That is, there are no patriotic noodles, only national unity noodles.
* Samdech Techo stated that keeping inflation low, including considering the price of gasoline, to ensure that the price of gasoline is not too expensive, electricity, reduce prices with the provision of social protection services as a strategy to maintain economic stability in Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that by the end of 2018, economic growth will reach 7.5 percent, compared to the target of 7.1 percent. This is a very big product for Cambodia in the context of a trade war.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the experience of lack of electricity in the dry season 2019 has made Cambodia release funds to buy generators from Finland and Germany to use to avoid repeated problems.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in the past, Phnom Penh needed only 30 megawatts of electricity, but now it needs up to about 1,000 megawatts.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that during his meeting with Swiss investors, Samdech supported the investment to build a new hospital because many Cambodians now go abroad for treatment.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in a meeting with Swiss investors, Samdech also supported human resource training, investment in power transmission lines, investment in technology and education.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that two major issues are facing in Phnom Penh today, including the lack of parking and the problem of garbage, which is up to 3,000 tons a day. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he had ordered Deputy Prime Minister Chea Sophara and Phnom Penh Governor Khuong Sreng to study the parking lot.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that a fraudulent company brought garbage to Cambodia. Now Cambodia is forcing them to leave.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Royal Government has made efforts to reform the competition. Samdech Techo said that Cambodia has now changed its face and Cambodia used to be short of food, but now Cambodia has become a rice exporter.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that rice exports to European countries continue despite taxes.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that efforts must be made to ensure that the Cambodian economy does not collapse, even if part of it is lost.
* Samdech Techo stated that the reform of transportation services and port services has significantly reduced costs.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the trick of splitting Samdech with Samdech Sar Kheng from Sam Rainsy prisoner was a child's game.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that about 400 European companies are doing business in Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the debt ratio for Cambodia is almost 40%, but Cambodia has just borrowed 21%, including old debt.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia and China are close, why is it necessary for China to establish a military base in Cambodia. Samdech Techo stated that in the history of China, troops were rarely sent abroad.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Constitution does not allow the presence of foreign troops on Cambodian soil, nor does it allow the presence of Cambodian troops on the territory of other countries. Except for troops serving under the United Nations umbrella.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that no matter whether the Chinese army or the army of any country must not be present on Cambodian territory. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia welcomes all for joint training with all countries.
* Samdech Techo Prime Minister stated that Samdech wants to ask Vietnam and Thailand to hold joint exercises on the border. But the exercise is to save people from various disasters.
* Samdech Techo stated that there are only three countries to help with infrastructure in Cambodia, including Japan, China and South Korea.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that China has helped to connect Cambodia internally. Only the connection between Samlot Battambang and Thmor Da in Pursat province remains.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the bank is ready to lend about $ 1 billion and Asia $ 600 million for development in Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Prime Minister said that if other countries are afraid of China having a strong influence on Cambodia, please invest like China. Cambodia does not discriminate against foreign investors.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen revealed that at the ASEAN Summit in Bangkok last month, Samdech and the Prime Minister of Malaysia, Mahathir Mohamad, moved to support more regional production.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen ended his speech with the Cambodian people in Switzerland at 00:45 Cambodian time.
