According to Mr. Pheng Nil, Branch Manager of CamControl in Svay Rieng Province, this promotion is a basic knowledge of "food safety" which is very important in society and daily life because of the responsibility for "food safety". It is the joint responsibility of professional institutions, importers, producers, distributors and all of us as consumers, because health is the key to survival.
Mr. Pheng Nil added that the current promotion is also to make students aware of the effects of eating unhealthy foods. Students should check the dates, names, items, cans, spoilers, chemicals placed on the food, keep it for a long time and do not eat any food that is not hygienic.
