Prof. Kisanti, Director of Kantha Bopha Hospital, said on July 3, 2019 that at the beginning of the rainy season, there will be an alarming increase in dengue fever, which can be considered an outbreak. Dengue fever has reached an outbreak of dengue fever, which is a long cycle, so people should be very careful about dengue fever, because there are people of all ages, both young and old.
The professor said that according to our observations at Kantha Bopha Hospital, the head has appeared since the beginning of the year, and the Ministry of Health is ready. But even though we are ready, the increase from the beginning of the year until July, especially at the end of May until the beginning of this month, there is a large increase, especially at Kantha Bopha Hospital.
"In the first two days of July, there were more than 500 new cases of dengue fever, and from the beginning of the year from January to the end of June, there were more than 1,500," he said. "Together, we must clean the environment around the house so that there is no clear water, which is a shelter for tiger mosquitoes, which are the transmitters of dengue fever."
