The number of Capital, Provincial, Municipal, District and Khan Council seats for the third mandate in 2019 is 4,114 seats, of which 559 are Capital / Provincial Council seats and 3,555 are Municipal / District / Khan Council seats. The constituencies are 11,572 Commune / Sangkat Councilors.
