CPP Members in the United States Celebrate the Party's 68th Birthday
The birthday celebration of the Cambodian People's Party, the ruling party of Cambodia, was held happily and cordially under the chairmanship of Mr. Chum Suntory, Ambassador of Cambodia to the United States and Mexico and Chairman of the Party Committee of the United States of America.
The ceremony is held in memory of the merits of the Cambodian People's Party, which has struggled to liberate the country and its people from war and genocide and has led the country to peace, stability and development. .
The speech also highlighted the commitment of Samdech Techo, President of the Cambodian People's Party to develop the country, protect the national interest and the people. In particular, the firm stance of maintaining peace, political stability and national security, which Cambodia has worked so hard to achieve, does not allow extremist opposition groups to betray the interests of the nation and the people or the biased environment outside. Can be destroyed, no matter what the cost.
The gathering to celebrate the 68th anniversary of the founding of the Cambodian People's Party went smoothly and happily. In particular, members expressed strong belief and support for the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen.
