(Phnom Penh): Five draft laws submitted by the Royal Government of Cambodia were fully approved by the National Assembly in the morning session on July 1, 2019.
The session was held at the National Assembly Palace under the chairmanship of Samdech Heng Samrin, President of the National Assembly, with the participation of 112 deputies.
1: Draft Law on the Approval of the Payment Guarantee of the Royal Government of the Kingdom of Cambodia to SPLP (Cambodia) Co., Ltd.
2: Draft Law on the Approval of the Payment Guarantee of the Royal Government of the Kingdom of Cambodia to Sternate New World Co., Ltd.
3. Draft Law on the Approval of the Payment Guarantee of the Royal Government of the Kingdom of Cambodia to Snettech Co., Ltd.
4. Draft law on the approval of the Kingdom of Cambodia to become a member of the agreement on port state measures to prevent and eliminate illegal fishing without report and without permission.
