On the occasion of transferring the management of Krousar Thmey School for the Blind and Deaf to the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports this morning, July 1, 2019, Samdech Techo Hun Sen reacted strongly to the scoring of Cambodia. Fall on this respect for human rights.
The head of the Royal Government of Cambodia, Samdech Techo, urged the Cambodian human rights activists to look at the situation in Cambodia 40 years ago and 40 years later. What is the difference? Samdech Techo Prime Minister also stated that human rights must talk about the right to live, to live, if there is no life can not talk about rights.
