Confiscated exhibits include: 8 packs of suspected drugs (4 small packs, 4 large packs and 1 mobile phone). Currently, the three suspects, including exhibits, are being interrogated temporarily to build a case. According to legal procedures, a man was killed and his body was dumped on National Road 8, Khsach Kandal District, Kandal Province.
