Police raid cockfighting and shootout location in Meanchey district, detain nine advisers of the Ministry of Interior, journalists and others
(Phnom Penh): Police raided and cracked down on a cockfighting and shooting of a large apple at the grass lot (abandoned) on Lum Road, Russey Village, Sangkat Stung Meanchey II, Khan Meanchey, Phnom Penh on June 30. This year, by detaining an adviser to the Ministry of Interior, a total of nine journalists and others.
