Key remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the occasion of transferring Krousar Thmey School under the control of the Ministry of Education
(Phnom Penh): On the morning of Monday, July 1, 2019, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, and Samdech Kittipritthbandit Bun Rany Hun Sen, President of the Red Cross. Cambodia has invited the management, teachers and students of Krousar Thmey School for the Blind and Deaf to transfer and transfer the management of the school to the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports.
Krousar Thmey School for the Blind and Deaf was first established in 1991 as the National Center for Education for the Blind and Deaf. The center is also a training center for teachers for the blind and deaf, as well as a place to publish and produce educational materials for the blind and deaf.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked the management, teachers and all the benefactors at Krousar Thmey School for their efforts in managing and training blind and deaf children.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen has agreed to allow Mr. Aing Sung to continue monitoring the Krousar Thmey School, even if it is transferred to the Ministry of Education to ensure that the transfer is successful.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech has spent about $ 247,625 for blind and deaf children to visit 37 times in the past.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that teachers at Krousar Thmey School received a stipend of about 800,000 Riels in addition to their salary because it was more difficult to teach blind and deaf children than to teach physically fit children.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen told Mr. Aing Sung to tell all donors not to worry about the transfer of Krousar Thmey School under the control of the Ministry of Education.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen has asked China, South Korea, Japan, the Asian Development Bank, the World Bank and the French Bank not to raise interest rates on Cambodian loans.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Krousar Thmey School, even though it was transferred to the Ministry of Education and the donors withdrew, the Royal Government did not allow it to collapse. Samdech Techo cited as an example that like Kantha Bopha Hospital, even though Mr. Richner died, this hospital is still operating normally.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in the coming days, Samdech will deliver a speech on human rights issues at the United Nations to show the progress of the Cambodian human rights process. Samdech Techo emphasized that human rights cannot be subject to shelling or war.
* Samdech Techo stated that in Cambodia for 40 years, people die every day, but Cambodia has taken bold steps. Samdech Techo stated that human rights start from the right to live, not to write a newspaper.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen continues to call on television stations to have sign language users during news hours to provide information to the deaf.
* Samdech Techo stated that after the transfer of Krousar Thmey School under the control of the Ministry of Education, twice a year meetings are still held and twice a year excursions are still maintained.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng for taking care of the new family in Battambang, Samdech Pichey Sena Tea Banh helped the new family in Siem Reap and Mr. Khieu Kanharith helped in the province. Kampong Cham.
* In response to the concerns of the Ministry of Education, Youth and Sports, Samdech Techo Hun Sen has decided to build a four-story building for a special institute for advanced training for blind and deaf children at Krousar Thmey School in Sangkat Phnom Penh Thmey, Khan Sen Sok.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the implementation of this protection program is not a coincidence, but want the people to be healthy, which is the responsibility of the Royal Government.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on the authorities to help look after the children of the victims who lost their lives due to the collapse of a building in Sihanoukville.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that all rescuers will be equipped with gold medals. Samdech Techo stated that the rescue operation in the building collapse in Sihanoukville was very well coordinated.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that rights are not just about expression, there are many kinds of rights.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he will meet with about 700 Cambodians in Europe. Samdech Techo calls on Cambodians in Europe to come out and receive Samdech. Samdech Techo also welcomed those who planned to demonstrate to welcome Samdech's trip.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen called on all blind and deaf children to study hard, that is, not to be mentally or physically disabled.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen said that Samdech will watch all TV channels at once, which channel does not provide opportunities for people with disabilities to go up and provide information?
* Samdech Techo announces that Samdech will issue funds to all TV channels if they do not have the budget for people with disabilities to sign up to provide information to people with disabilities.
* Samdech Techo Prime Minister expressed his belief that after the transfer to the Ministry of Education, the management of Krousar Thmey School will not go backwards.
