In order to enhance the effectiveness of development, the Royal Government has set out five in-depth reform policies and approaches aimed at improving competition, developing human resources, maintaining economic growth, and creating favorable conditions for investment in order to ensure the sustainability and sustainability of economic growth. By the environment to turn Cambodia into a high middle income country by 2030 and a high income country by 2050.
