(Phnom Penh): Chip Mong Inc. Cement Corporation (CMIC) is an investment company in a large cement plant and equipped with leading technology in Cambodia. After gaining support and success in the market, the company has produced a new brand of cement called "Strong Camel" and officially launched and distributed in the Cambodian market from July.
