Regarding the case of the explosion that caused the injuries, Mr. Oun Sinath, Prey Veng Provincial Administrative Director, said that the case of cracking down on fishing crimes in Peam Chor district and the explosion, his forces did not participate. That is a crackdown police officer, as he has to receive the form and the suspect tomorrow to be charged and sent to court.
