He said that during the crackdown, the fishing boats saw the police chasing and intercepting their boats, they ran and intended to collide with the police. At that time, the police fired up and fired at Pok, but also hit the pilot in the leg, causing one injury, causing injuries. Cambodia in Kratie Province
