(Phnom Penh): On the afternoon of Saturday, June 29, 2019, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, once again thanked the Cambodian Red Cross, the Association of Company Owners and all the philanthropists who donated money to The victims of the building collapse in Sihanoukville on June 22, 2019, at the request of Samdech.
