It should be noted that in relation to this case of smuggling pigs, the Governor of Svay Rieng Province has warned officials stationed at all border crossings to prevent any side in the crackdown on the import of live pigs as well as pork. Anyone who dares to allow pigs in must decide to remove (surgery) because this is the fifth approach of the head of the Royal Government of Cambodia, Samdech Techo Hun Sen.
The Ministry of Agriculture has recently banned the import of pigs from Vietnam to prevent African swine fever and encourage domestic breeding.
