Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng calls on all relevant departments and institutions in Kampong Cham to support Mr. Un Chanda like Mr. Kouch Chamroeun to achieve the goal of building prosperity in the province
(Kampong Cham): Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng, Deputy Prime Minister and Minister of Interior, called on the relevant departments and institutions to support Mr. Un Chanda, the new Governor of Kampong Cham, like Mr. Kouch Chamroeun, the former Governor of this province, in order to achieve the goal of making Kampong Cham more There is continuous progress.
