(Phnom Penh): The director of the National Children's Hospital, Dr. Nhep Angka Bos, said that severe diarrhea often causes children to lack food, lose a lot of nutrients and protein in the body, and when the stomach and intestines do not absorb enough nutrients, children change. Lean, lacking in strength, the immune system is weakened, and children are vulnerable to other diseases and accidents.
"Diarrhea will cause memory, memory problems and other problems to occur to the extent that the child is malnourished, so we need to treat him malnutrition," said Dr. Nhep Angka Bos.
The doctor stated, "We need to note that diarrhea, frequent stools, diarrhea, fever / no fever, frequent diarrhea, thirst, pale eyes, wrinkled skin, small children for this condition, the child is malnourished. "There is a lot of water, so he must be rushed to the hospital for proper treatment, otherwise it can be fatal if not treated, especially children under 2 years old."
Due to this problem, we have invited all doctors in various hospitals and students to participate so that we can share our experience in treating pediatric diseases more appropriately to the type of disease according to the technical skills.
At the same time, Dr. Nhep Angka Bos called on all parents to keep their children clean, including food for children to eat clean, in addition, parents must wash their hands and feet before handling toys and children's food. Especially enemies, live clean, drink clean, eat clean always.
