Backstage of the ASEAN Summit in Bangkok
(Phnom Penh): The 34th ASEAN Summit was held in Bangkok, Thailand from 22 to 23 June 2019. Puy Kea, a journalist for the Japan Kyodo Agency in Cambodia, is always on the lookout for this regional meeting.
Apart from being interested in formal meeting events, Mr. Puy Kea also monitored activities outside the meeting, calling it a "off-stage event". The following are the behind-the-scenes stories of the ASEAN Summit noted by Puy Kea.
