Meeting with party officials and activists in this meeting, Mr. Vongsey Visoth said that in the past 68 years, the party has gone through many stages and fulfilled a series of missions to serve the country and the people in accordance with the actual situation of The country at each stage, having done everything for our nation to live and the people to have a prosperous life.
He said the party's continued rule and the achievement of its glorious achievements over the past 40 years were not coincidental, as the party had the right and consistent political path. Take the people as a whole and put the national interest first in all circumstances, and especially the party has a very good, strong and realistic leader.
