Mr. Vongsy Visoth stated, "Democracy is a process that takes a long time and yes, it is just a word, as some people have always said. We want a democracy that can ensure the peace, stability and long-term development of Cambodia. We are all proud of the phased democratization process in Cambodia. ”
(Battambang): Inauguration of a new library worth nearly 20,000 USD at Sala Ballat Primary School in Sala Battambang Village, Sangkat Watkor, Battambang Municipality, Battambang Province, Mr. Youk Bunna, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Public Works and Director of the Royal School of Administration Encourage students to read books regularly to increase their knowledge as a bridge to the future.
