Mr. Youk Bunna and Mr. Uy Sotheavy would like to thank the Korean philanthropists from different places who donated money together to build a new library for Ballat Primary School as a contribution to the construction and development of education in Cambodia. At the same time, all the Korean philanthropists who have spent money to help build this library for the school at a cost of nearly 20,000 dollars is a new achievement for Battambang province.
