According to photos posted on social media, several protesters in and around the Bahraini embassy in Baghdad on Thursday evening waved Palestinian flags and burned American and Israeli flags. . The protesters are angry with the Bahraini government for hosting a peace conference to end the US-led Israeli-Palestinian conflict.
