Boeung Keng Kang district officials said that the inspection of this unusual building was done under the order of Mr. Khuong Sreng, the governor of Phnom Penh. This regulation is also in line with the announcement to order all 14 district governors to inspect all buildings built within their jurisdiction.
The governor of Phnom Penh has warned that any district governor who causes the wrong building to be built within his jurisdiction will be subject to administrative discipline and be held accountable before the law.
According to the district official, the authorities want the construction engineer in Sangkat Toul Svay Prey 1 in Boeung Keng Kang district to show in detail that the metal building has the right support that can accommodate visitors or visitors to the building. Anyway? Officials have asked for a forensic examination to determine the extent to which the building can be placed by an engineer or by an independent engineer who is authorized by the authorities.
