(Phnom Penh): Mr. Chea Pisey, Governor of Russey Keo District, announced his apology from the public, especially the apology from all levels of leaders for inappropriate gestures during yesterday's ceremony unintentionally caused by his personal health problems.
The apology of Mr. Chea Pisey Kha Leu came after the posting of a message and attached a picture of him on Facebook that fell asleep may be very tired of work. Base in the International Day Against Disposal on the morning of June 26, 2019 at the Koh Pich Theater under the presidency of Prince Sar Kheng.
