General Professor Chea Dara, on behalf of the Vice Chancellor, the Deputy Principals of the five faculties, the directors of the three centers, the military, the students and all the trainees of the National Defense University, was overjoyed and congratulated on the occasion. The Senior General took on a new task, worthy of his countless acts of heroism and great sacrifice in the cause of national defense.
