SUGANO Yuichi also said that the project has also developed guidelines for vehicle registration and inspection. In addition, the project supports IT systems through the provision of IT tools to increase system efficiency and simplify application procedures. Man commits suicide by pouring gasoline on himself without knowing the reason in Spean Khpos village, Sangkat Kilometer 6, Khan Russey Keo
