(Phnom Penh): In order to facilitate the easier way for tour operators and tourism business owners to apply for a tourism license or renew the tourism license, the Ministry of Tourism is cooperating with the relevant ministries to study the adjustment and reduction of some complex conditions, if According to Mr. Nep Samuth, General Manager of Tourism Industry.
He added that tour operators do not need to come to the Ministry of Tourism or the Department of Tourism to apply for a tourism license, just open their computers and go to the website of the Ministry of Tourism, fill out the application form correctly and pay as scheduled. Through the banking system. In this way, it saves time and money to travel back and forth.
In 2018, the total revenue of tourism licenses was 3,352 million riels, while in the first five months of 2019, the Ministry of Tourism collected 1,793 million riels, equivalent to 48.95% of the original budget of 2019 and revenue from tourism services. 95 million Riels, equivalent to 54% of the 2019 budget for tourism services.
