Ministry of Land Management adds technical working group to inspect the quality of construction in Preah Sihanouk province (Video inside) (Phnom Penh): The Ministry of Land Management issued a decision on June 26, 2019 to adjust the composition and add technical working group to Support more construction quality inspection work in Sihanoukville.
The revised technical team consists of up to 17 teams, ranging from the Secretary of State to the Director of the Department. This technical team supports the mission of the Construction Quality Inspection Commission in Sihanoukville.
The team has the following tasks:
* Inspected the implementation of technical standards, legal standards, construction standards, safety standards and construction quality at construction sites in Sihanoukville.
* Inspected the qualifications of the construction contractor at the construction site.
* Report the results to the Construction Quality Control Committee in Preah Sihanouk Province
Perform other duties as assigned by the Construction Quality Control Commission in Sihanoukville.
