This state-of-the-art theater, equipped with high-standard technical equipment, is the first theater in Kampong Speu to be built as a venue for cultural and educational exchanges. The theater is 16 meters long and 30 meters wide, decorated with colorful curtains and equipped with high-quality technical equipment and modern speakers, which received 221 visitors.
The backyard and artificial turf football table is also a new place for students to sit and read, relax, exercise, and especially these new achievements are also a venue for organizing youth and other public events.
Mr. HUN Many, Member of Parliament for Kampong Speu Constituency, who has been active in mobilizing philanthropists to build many new achievements and solve various problems for the people of Kampong Speu, said that more new achievements have appeared in Kampong Speu and in the Kampong Speu library, such as the Kampong Speu Library Festival, the back garden and the artificial grass football table for all the people in Kampong Speu.
