Speaking at a roundtable discussion at the Royal Academy of Cambodia on the topic of "What will happen when Sam Rainsy returns to Cambodia," Dr. Sok Touch said: "Foreign pressure is just a put, but put "Somehow, it made Cambodia stronger. Just then, Samdech Techo, he started kicking five feet already Foreign pressure is not pressure, they make Cambodia work hard."
Mr. Sok Touch emphasized that the reason he claimed that the pressure was an opportunity for Cambodia to strengthen its internal position was because Samdech Techo Hun Sen had recently changed some conditions to facilitate the trade of traders. Both export and import.
At the same time, Dr. Sok Touch also claimed that the statement that foreign pressure is a way to open a political channel for Sam Rainsy prisoners who are fleeing from law enforcement by the Cambodian authorities is untrue. No, that is a lie for political gain only.
Similarly, Mr. Phay Siphan, Minister Delegate to the Prime Minister and Chairman of the Royal Government Spokesperson Unit, also highlighted that Mr. Sam Rainsy was a fraudster who fabricated information related to the case of foreign support because Mr. Sam Rainsy himself never stood. In the United Nations.
Mr. Phay Siphan emphasized that "I would like to confirm whether the person (Mr. Sam Rainsy) has a photo of the United Nations or a photo of him standing with a UN guard. I believe that everyone has an answer, and seeing people sitting on the UN forum is not. Therefore, fabrication of information to attract the attention of citizens who receive information is not complete.
Mr. Phay Siphan considers this fabrication to be one of the most shameful things of Mr. Sam Rainsy himself, while the Royal Government always welcomes the desire to return to Cambodia and the competent forces are ready. To arrest the prisoner and bring him to justice.
