The last act that Samdech Hun Sen did in connection with the collapse of a seven-story building in Sihanoukville really touched my heart as well as the hearts of Cambodians across the country to recall all the activities that the Cambodian leader This was done almost all his life for the cause of his nation and his beloved compatriots.
Just got off the plane from a foreign meeting, Samdech Hun Sen, as a true leader of the country, immediately got in the car and went to Sihanoukville without thinking of fatigue, and he followed The long road until past midnight to reach the destination.
With a sad face in a tired and sleepy situation, the Prime Minister never complained a single word. His feelings are very close to the family of the victim, who is his blood relative, and he always treats him like a relative.
Because he was a Cambodian and had a special instinct from birth, Hun Sen was confused in anticipation that some survivors might be buried in the rubble of the building. . It was his special instincts that prompted him to order search teams to step up rescue operations.
Finally, when Samdech Hun Sen arrived at the scene again, the other two surviving workers were found by the rescue team. Excited, overwhelmed and in tears, the Prime Minister boarded an ambulance to meet with the victims, and especially wiped their faces. They go to the hospital directly. What leader in the world can do that?
The mission was completed on January 7, 1979. However, his mission did not end with the liberation of Cambodia from death. There is still much work for Hun Sen to do: one hand to prevent the return of the genocidal regime, and the other hand to rebuild the country from the ashes under international political and economic pressure. Direction.
As a leader, I dare say that this leader never ran away from the people and never avoided problems. On the contrary, where there is suffering, there really is the face of Prime Minister Hun Sen.
