Ministry of Tourism raises awareness of Cambodian hotel and accommodation rating system in Siem Reap
(Siem Reap): In order to avoid confusion between the hotel rating system and the satisfaction rating by the website of the foreign company, the Ministry of Tourism held a workshop in Siem Reap on the evening of June 24, 2019 to provide knowledge about the hotel rating system. And comprehensive accommodation and tourism services in Cambodia.
The workshop on "Cambodian Hotel and Accommodation Rating System" was held at Angkor Century Hotel, Siem Reap, with 200 participants representing hotels, restaurants, travel agencies.
Mr. Nep Samuth, Managing Director of the Tourism Industry and Chairman of the Commission for the Evaluation and Classification of Hotels and Tourism Services, confirmed that the rating system was approved by sub-decree and was strictly different from other rating agencies of outside agencies. Country.
He suggested that all tourism businesses should implement the obligation to apply for star rating as defined in Article 6 of the sub-decree on hotel and tourism accommodation rating services. In addition, he reiterated to all businesses, services, accommodation, tourism, not to publish the rating without the recognition of the Ministry of Tourism in any form.
